# First-person refraction (dclf-roadmap.md 4.2): Flames (12fcd) in both hands, drawn, in first person with DCLF's first person on,
# at the newest save. The census's "[DCLF] census view first person's geometries" line names what the engine still draws there:
# HeatRefraction (Lighting, refraction under a billboard) stays the engine's until 4.2 is built. Shots of the hands still and
# turning, then with DCLF's draws off (dclf:feature=0) for comparison.
CS_DCLF_FIRST_PERSON=1
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_DCLF_CENSUS=1
CS_DCLF_STATS=1
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=300:player.addspell 12fcd;320:player.equipspell 12fcd left;340:player.equipspell 12fcd right;400:dclf:pov=first;450:dclf:draw=1;900:dclf:shot=flames1;940:dclf:shot=flames2;1300:dclf:shot=flames-turn;1600:dclf:feature=0;1900:dclf:shot=flames-off1;1940:dclf:shot=flames-off2
CS_DCLF_TEST_TURN=1000:1300:0.2
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=2100
